{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:41 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"啟德啟欣苑銀主事故盤推拍 原業主欠賭債燒炭亡 叫價290萬元低估價19% \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00293a6a968a9bcaa97414cf4a7b9147/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_5_40_43_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<p>啟欣苑鄰近啟德商圈，加上於去年初開始入伙，因此備受市場關注。其中A座啟潤閣低層21室一伙銀主盤，以居二巿場價290萬元推拍，較市場估價的低19%。</p>\n<p>上述單位面積447方呎，銀主以綠表價290萬元推拍，較市場估價的約360萬元低70萬元或19%，呎價約6488元，將於12月2日（下周三）進行拍賣，同場共有約30項物業可供競投。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/937af4531c8b73f9c411c91ad09033b9/2026-11/KT8.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1fe38fd2f5655aff2783b22066ed078a/2026-11/KT1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94c286a42fe1eae014e8cc1cbdae54bd/2026-11/KT2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1dfd0b646bcfaf94da82d1212502f720/2026-11/KT6.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecbb0a749ff16f82cb29aae830793d00/2026-11/KT4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59aa869033e24786ff79b8f84c4880d3/2026-11/KT5.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2994e4eab041707684209a9c4063c9d1/2026-11/KT10.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/107c450044c262f89ef0250e00453738/2026-11/KT11.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e43f70b0828d78b58ad3d0724015954/2026-11/KT7.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1627577533750c957fab964ab2c7a1f0/2026-11/KT12.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1dac1ef1dfdb9a7e2a5306da8b6d142d/2026-11/KT3.jpg\"/>\n<p>值得一提為，該單位同屬事故戶，原業主於去年斥資374.76萬元購入上址，並因賭博欠債問題，最終在今年年初燒炭自殺，而由於財務問題，單位亦一直未有進行裝修，維持「清水」狀態。</p>\n<p>相關文章：啟德兩房居屋變度假屋捱轟 裝修公司發文後急刪除 留意房署列明業主須實際長住</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.681917+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:41:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:37:33.140837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:24.833506+00:00","content_hash":"3f8e8f4fc4ff77c0098118d9403e23ea0140a64191418a8f1264ce3039314703","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}